{"obsah":"<p>Lukáš Valný, Tobík Dolák and Vlasta Kabeláč Čiháček accepted an invitation from the Sokol members of Moravany near Pardubice to their traditional ball. The dance floor was extra slippery, but luckily we got through without a crash. A great crowd full of athletes, a caring organiser and a good mood gave the exhibition just the right dynamics. We rode the obstacles, a competition and jumps over volunteers. Thanks for the invitation – hopefully see you in the summer.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.27.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.27.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250496\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.31.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.31.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250501\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.50.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2025%2F03%2FSnimek-obrazovky-2025-03-01-v-10.11.50.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-250497\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"